# The other order of ms-marvel-equipped-with-wrecking-ball-arm-before-the-grant: Bot1 bolts Ms. Marvel first on turn 3 (her base
# power is the hand, one card, toughness 4), and only then equips Wrecking Ball Arm. The Equipment gets a new timestamp as it
# becomes attached (CR 613.7e), later than her grant (CR 613.7a), so its layer 7b "base power and toughness 7/7" wins: 7/7 until
# the end of turn, the granted ability still there but overridden.

